   Group Key: '{ "" : null }'::bson
   ->  Index Scan using _id_ on documentdb_data.documents_21301 collection
         Output: '{ "" : null }'::bson, document
         Index Cond: (collection.shard_key_value = '21301'::bigint)
(6 rows)

