   Output: bson_repath_and_build('_id'::text, '{ "" : null }'::bson, 'items'::text, bson_array_agg(bson_expression_get(document, '{ "" : "$a" }'::bson, false, '{ "now" : NOW_SYS_VARIABLE }'::bson), ''::text, true)), ('{ "" : null }'::bson)
   Group Key: '{ "" : null }'::bson
   ->  Index Only Scan using a_1 on documentdb_data.documents_21301 collection
         Output: '{ "" : null }'::bson, document
         Index Cond: (collection.document @<> '{ "a" : { "fullScan" : true } }'::bson)
(6 rows)

-- Dotted-path accumulator on the indexed nested field "e.f": the hint is
