   Group Key: '{ "" : null }'::bson
   ->  Index Only Scan using e_f_1 on documentdb_data.documents_21301 collection
         Output: '{ "" : null }'::bson, document
         Index Cond: (collection.document @<> '{ "e.f" : { "fullScan" : true } }'::bson)
(6 rows)

