-- =============================================================================
-- GUC sanity: enable_scalar_aggregate_accumulator_path_collection gates path
-- collection *upstream* of enable_scalar_aggregate_index_pushdown.  With the
-- collection GUC OFF, no accumulator paths are gathered, so even with the
-- pushdown GUC ON no fullScan hint is emitted and the plan falls back to the
-- baseline _id index scan.
